// W3 (rec writer; lead 18: fields from plans/rec-traditions-plan.html FINAL and the brief; RA owns the format).
// Paddle club: Wednesdays 18:30-19:30 from Day 3, the river hall; Chief Holt, the slow loop (the fast run comes with White
// water's integration, lead 17's call 3). FOR RA: kayak places are yours (written as rec:kayak; 3-4 kayaks, the dock
